# newdoc id = texts/birchbark/439
# date_created = 1200-1220
# transl_ru = От Моисея к Спирку. Если Матей не взял ({или:} Что касается того, что Матей не взял) у тебя капь [воска], отправь ее с Прусом ко мне. А я олово распродал и свинец и весь кованый товар. Уже мне не ехать в Суздаль. Воску куплено три капи. А тебе прибыть сюда. Возьми с собой олова примерно четыре безмена [и] примерно два красных полотенца ({по-видимому,} листы красной меди). А деньги плати сразу же.
# transl_en_1 = (From) ... to Spirok. If Matei has not taken from you the kapi (lit. “head”) [of wax], [then] send it to me with the Prussian. And I sold all of the tin, lead, and all of the forged [metal] goods (klepanie). Now, I do not have a [need] to go to Suzdal’. Three kapi (lit. “heads”) of wax have been purchased. And you [need to] come here. Take [with you] about 4 bezmen of lead [and] about 2 red towels (apparently, sheets of red copper). And give money (i.e., pay) [for these goods] immediately.
# transl_en_2 = [+ From Moise]j [to] Spirko. If Matej hasn’t taken the batch (of wax) from you, ship it to me with Prus; I’ve sold off the tin and lead and all the wrought wares. I no longer have to go to Suzdal’. Of the wax, 3 batches have been bought. You have to come here. Ship some tin—about four lots, about two sheets of the red (copper)—and pay the money immediately
# page_id = 439
# sent_id = 439-1
# sent_transl_ru = От Моисея к Спирку.
# sent_transl_en = (From) ... to Spirok.
# text = (+ ѿ) [моисе]ѧ [ко] спирокѹ
1	(+	+	SYM	_	_	5	discourse	_	wf="(+"|line_id="1"|addr="439:1"
2	ѿ)	отъ	ADP	PR,gvrn:gen,reconstr	_	3	case	_	wf="отъ"|comment="gvrn:gen,reconstr"|addr="439:1"
3	[моисе]ѧ	Моисѣи	PROPN	S,persn,m,sg?,gen	Case=Gen|Gender=Masc|NameType=Giv|Number=Sing	5	orphan	_	wf="моисея"|comment="sg?,number_unsure"|addr="439:1"
4	[ко]	къ	ADP	PR,gvrn:dat	_	5	case	_	wf="ко"|comment="gvrn:dat"|addr="439:1"
