# transl_ru = Поклон от попа Гречину. Напиши для меня двух шестокрылых ангелов на двух иконках, [чтобы поставить] сверху деисуса. Приветствую тебя. А Бог вознаградит или сладимся (о цене).
# transl_en_1 = Greetings from the priest (to) Grechin. Paint for me two six-winged angels on two icons, [so as to place] (them) above Deisis. [I] kiss you (i.e., My best regards). And as for the payment, God [will be] the guarantor or [we] will make the agreement later.
# transl_en_2 = A bow from the priest to Grečin. Paint for me two six-winged angels on two small icons above the Intercession. And I salute you. God (will be the guarantor) for the reward, or else we two can come to terms.
